### G1 actual Billing smoke through Gateway. Populate variables privately from the test environment.
### Never commit tokens or patient PII. Source tuple must come from its producer, not Billing SQL.
### Use a fresh source and source-verified Billing test flags/catalog; coordinate with Lộc for a shared environment.
### No request here enables deployment gates. Do not use the historical golden fixture IDs as live IDs.
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### Human ADMIN access token; exact EXAM appointmentId / LAB_TEST labId / PRESCRIPTION prescriptionId.
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose={{purpose}}&sourceId={{sourceId}}&patientId={{patientId}}&careEpisodeId={{careEpisodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{discoveryCorrelationUuid}}

### Repeat with CASHIER, expect the same exact persisted source relationships.
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose={{purpose}}&sourceId={{sourceId}}&patientId={{patientId}}&careEpisodeId={{careEpisodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAccessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{cashierCorrelationUuid}}

### Payment ID, currency and amount come exclusively from the successful discovery response.
### CompleteLedgerPaymentRequest wire shape; only use a payable new request approved for this test.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/{{paymentRequestIdFromDiscovery}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAccessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{paymentCorrelationUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "{{newPaymentOperationKey}}",
  "amount": {{remainingAmountFromDiscovery}},
  "currency": "{{currencyFromDiscovery}}",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}

### Read back the same source tuple: compare paidAmount / remainingAmount / status and request ID.
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose={{purpose}}&sourceId={{sourceId}}&patientId={{patientId}}&careEpisodeId={{careEpisodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{readbackCorrelationUuid}}

### Billing validation: forwarded to Billing, expected 400 INVALID_REQUEST with same correlation.
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose=EXAM&sourceId=malformed&patientId={{patientId}}&careEpisodeId={{careEpisodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{validationCorrelationUuid}}
